{
  "name": "ordinario-agent-base-share-tie",
  "description": "Rounding tie of the withholding base share (section 8: half up, once per document). Commercial agent (art. 25-bis DPR 600/1973), withholding 23 % on 50 % of the commissions, Italian business client (withholding agent), commissions €1,000.05. VAT 22 % × 1,000.05 = 220.011 -> €220.01; total 1,000.05 + 220.01 = €1,220.06. Withholding base 50 % × 1,000.05 = 500.025 -> €500.03 (halfUp; halfEven would give 500.02); withholding 23 % × 500.03 = 115.0069 -> €115.01 (on 500.02 it would be 115.0046 -> 115.00); net payable 1,220.06 − 115.01 = €1,105.05.",
